      "The the placement lead owns the decision in site visit preparation completion; the preparer may compare, label, and route but may not approve the outcome. When urgency presses against the limit, pause and route the decision. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. For site visit preparation completion, compare visit request with the destination value rather than relying on a status label. When urgency presses against the limit, pause and route the decision. If the team cannot reproduce the result from the record, the control is not finished. Write the authority limit into the case template. In this site visit preparation completion case, the record points to the placement record and names the placement lead as the decision owner.",
      "## Evidence dictionary",
      "Each morning the team reviews site visit preparation completion arrivals, items waiting on the the placement lead, and items ready for a verified close. Assign every unowned case before new work begins. If the team cannot reproduce the result from the record, the control is not finished. A handoff is complete only when the receiver acknowledges it. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. The site visit preparation completion record should let a second reviewer rebuild the decision from checklist and attendee list. Do not let a deadline expand a role beyond its written limit. A handoff is complete only when the receiver acknowledges it. A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. For site visit preparation completion, the working file keeps visit request and checklist beside the decision note.",
      "## Sampling and collection",
      "If the record does not match the surviving value, stop the dependent action and log the conflict in the placement record rather than choosing the more convenient value. Do not rewrite the earlier record to match the later answer. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. A site visit preparation completion exception keeps approval note attached and routes the question to the placement lead. An escalation that ends in silence remains open. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. The site visit preparation completion case note should show what the placement record held at the time and who reviewed it.",
      "## Analysis and reporting",
