      "## Limitations",
      "Review site visit preparation completion with a sample drawn from the queue export before the meeting, so the discussion cannot drift to memorable cases. Use case-level review to explain an outlier before calling it a trend. End the review with one change and one measure. Report a null result as clearly as a positive one. Check whether the definition changed during the period. The site visit preparation completion close note cites the placement record, the approver, and the time of the final check. Keep the prior procedure available for comparison. Do not let a deadline expand a role beyond its written limit. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. The site visit preparation completion reviewer records approval note, the owner, and the next action in one place.",
